# NAME: AI
# AUTHOR: Muse for Wen Ze
# REPO: https://github.com/zwz0607/surge-rules
# UPDATED: 2026-11-25
# NOTE: Only AI services, no broad shared domains (no bing.com, googleapis.com, gstatic.com, auth0.com, stripe.com, sentry.io). Those would hijack unrelated traffic.
# NOTE: URL-REGEX removed in this version, Gemini main domains are still covered.
# USAGE (Loon): Remote Rule, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/zwz0607/surge-rules@main/rule/Loon/AI.list

